Scroll Studio – Privacy Policy


Last updated: 31-08-2025


Scroll Studio (“we”, “our”, “us”) provides the Scroll Studio Shopify app (the “App”). This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when merchants install and use our App.


Information We Collect


When you install the App, Shopify provides us with access to certain basic information about your store, such as:
&nbsp;• Store name
&nbsp;• Store URL
&nbsp;• Contact email address


We do not collect or request any information from your customers.


How We Use This Information


We use the information provided by Shopify to:
&nbsp;• Enable the App to function within your store
&nbsp;• Authenticate and communicate with your store through Shopify’s APIs
&nbsp;• Provide support if you contact us
&nbsp;• Send you important updates about the App (for example: new features, service changes, or important notices)


We will not use your email address for unrelated marketing outside of the App.


Data Storage &amp; Sharing


We do not store merchant or customer data outside of Shopify beyond what is necessary for communication and support.
We do not share your information with third parties.


Customer Data


The App does not access or process any customer information (such as orders, addresses, or payment details).


Your Rights


If you would like to remove the App and its permissions, you can uninstall it at any time from your Shopify admin. This will revoke our access to your store information.


You can also contact us to request that we remove your information from our systems.


